#X text 60 87 [numbox~] is a signal GUI number box. It can be used to display/monitor signal values at a fixed rate or generate them with a ramp time., f 71;
#X text 349 130 <-- click and drag;
#X text 227 475 - input when monitoring or generated values instead;
#X text 227 288 -;
#X text 239 288 sets initialization and generating value with given float or sets current value if no float is given., f 51;
